- FMA count is 0 in all 20 jobs across both ISAs at all opt-levels/target-cpu settings (grep covers vfmadd*/vfnmadd*/vfmsub*/vfnmsub*/fmadd/fmsub/fnmadd/fnmsub/fmla/fmls); this is expected since CIS-2 sec3.2 forbids `.mul_add(` in source (no fused multiply-add construct exists to compile down regardless of opt-level).
- Weight download hit HuggingFace exactly once per run (fetch-weights job), cached via actions/cache keyed on the resolved HF revision sha and distributed to the 20 build jobs via actions/upload-artifact + actions/download-artifact.
- Rule A: no timing numbers reported.
